  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0: Logs in with SolarEdge's new OAuth flow (the old login answers HTTP 410). Solar forecast (today, tomorrow, power now, actual vs forecast) from Open-Meteo by default or Forecast.Solar, for up to 3 roof faces, with fallback between the two and a correction learned from your production; existing forecast users move to Open-Meteo unless Forecast.Solar is chosen. gridStatus is idle within 100 W of 0, so a battery no longer makes it flip every minute. Battery charged/discharged worked out from power; EV devices polled only while charging; warnings for stale or failing answers and a raw-data button; summary line with units on every device.",
